{"id": "EUVD-2022-56036", "enisaUuid": "a64faada-c14e-3fd6-946e-d95f790618bf", "description": "PocketMine-MP before 4.7.2 fails to properly handle exceptions from the adhocore/json-comment library when parsing skin geometry data. Attackers can send login or skin packets with invalid geometry JSON to trigger an unhandled RuntimeException, causing server crash.", "datePublished": "2026-09-06T12:00:24", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-08T15:20:53", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/pmmp/PocketMine-MP/security/advisories/GHSA-8cwq-4cmf-px73", "https://github.com/pmmp/PocketMine-MP/commit/c9626c610b8f6810c8c987559c9197b2a291f0bb", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/pocketmine-mp-before-4.7.2-denial-of-service-via-skin-geometry"], "aliases": ["GHSA-pmcx-fxxc-37gm", "CVE-2022-51009"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.34, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2bdc9960-66d3-33a7-854c-51c3d0d4a5c9", "product": {"name": "PocketMine-MP", "vendor": {"name": "pmmp"}}, "product_version": "0 <4.7.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "181fc943-be4a-3f92-866a-a3b7176247ca", "vendor": {"name": "pmmp"}}], "isExploited": false}